### Login (local defaults)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "demo", "password": "demo123"}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.accessToken); %}

### List people (page 1, size 3)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/people?page=1&size=3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter people by name
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/people?name=skywalker
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter people by id and name
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/people?id=1&name=luke
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter films by title
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/films?title=jedi
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Starship detail
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/starships/9
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Vehicles, out-of-range page (empty content, real totals)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/vehicles?page=99
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Unknown id (404 ProblemDetail)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/people/9999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Without token (401 ProblemDetail)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/people

### GraphQL: people page and a film detail in one request
POST http://localhost:8080/graphql
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "{ people(name: \"skywalker\") { content { id name } totalElements } film(id: 1) { title episodeId director } }"
}

### GraphQL: unknown id (null with a NOT_FOUND error)
POST http://localhost:8080/graphql
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "{ person(id: 9999) { name } }"
}

### MCP: list the tools (stateless Streamable HTTP, JSON-RPC 2.0)
POST http://localhost:8080/mcp
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1, "method": "tools/list"}

### MCP: call search_people
POST http://localhost:8080/mcp
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 2, "method": "tools/call", "params": {"name": "search_people", "arguments": {"name": "skywalker"}}}
